      "message": "The canary links are in a little bit of a funny state, but chrome and g3 both pass. I landed layout test suppressions for a few images in chromium (https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3758676) and disabled a unit test in g3 (https://critique.corp.google.com/cl/461599369/analysis) that would have blocked this roll. \n\nAll the test failures from the canaries and the gold diffs appear to be off-by-1s from rounding. The GPU shows so many changes because we go through this code path when packing a float4 color into a uint32 for vertex attribute data.",
